{'symbol': 'REGN', 'date': '2021-10-14 07:21:00', 'title': 'FDA ACCEPTS REGEN-COV® (CASIRIVIMAB AND IMDEVIMAB) FOR PRIORITY REVIEW FOR TREATMENT AND PROPHYLAXIS OF COVID-19', 'text': 'TARRYTOWN, N.Y., OCT. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0REGENERON\xa0PHARMACEUTICALS, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: REGN) TODAY\xa0ANNOUNCED THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS ACCEPTED FOR PRIORITY REVIEW A BIOLOGICS LICENSE APPLICATION (BLA) FOR REGEN-COV® (CASIRIVIMAB AND IMDEVIMAB) TO TREAT COVID-19 IN NON-HOSPITALIZED PATIENTS AND AS PROPHYLAXIS IN CERTAIN INDIVIDUALS.'}